@page "/"

<h1>Tsazor Fluent — Gallery</h1>
<p class="intro">
    The stability proof: a real component library, built the Blazor way but in
    TypeScript. Fifteen launch components render on their own pages with all
    their states; the dashboard below exercises them together — tables with
    filter, sort and paging, a validated form, dialogs and toasts.
</p>

